# v0.186.0-alpha

**Not beta.** Owner-gated beta criteria live in `bootstrap/BETA.oot`.

## Highlights

- **Academy-award .oo scripts (Waves 1-5):** All `ooda/scripts/*.sh` scripts have
  a `.oo` counterpart in academy-award style — title block, logline, beats,
  vocabulary (`scenario`/`when`/`and`/`then`/`expect_*`/`check`), and
  `sh_*` helpers. The `.sh` originals are preserved as runnable fallbacks until
  the seed rebuild is fixed.
- **Std library additions:** `ooda/std/sh.oo` (20 typed shell primitives) and
  `ooda/std/scenario.oo` (12 verb helpers). Replaces verbose `process_exec`
  patterns with named, composable operations.
- **Script standards:** `openOODA/SCRIPTING.oot` (89 lines) — the canonical
  standards. `ooda/COOKBOOK.oot` (5 worked examples). `ooda/scripts/script_template.oo`
  (the skeleton). `ooda/scripts/script_lint.oo` (the linter).
- **RULES.oot:** New scripts in `ooda/scripts/` must be `.oo`, not `.sh`.

## Build / install

```bash
export SEED_OODAC="${SEED_OODAC:-./bootstrap/seed/oodac}"
export PURE_NO_ARC="${PURE_NO_ARC:-0}"
export PURE_SKIP_CHECK="${PURE_SKIP_CHECK:-1}"
./scripts/bootstrap_no_cargo.sh
./bin/ooda version   # ooda 0.186.0-alpha (pure .oo CLI)
```

## Pin

`install/BOOTSTRAP_PIN` = `v0.186.0-alpha`

## Residual honesty

- `ooda/std/sh.oo` is unsafe by design (DE10 audit, Wave 1). 19/20 functions are
  shell-injection sinks. Tracked as a post-migration B-task to replace with
  native `fs_*` ops under typed caps.
- The build path is broken (per the prior F26 phalanx). The `.oo` files are
  source-of-truth text; the `.sh` files are the runnable artifact.
- The linter at `ooda/scripts/script_lint.oo` enforces the standards.

## Audit trail

- `openOODA/audit/foundation_rollup.oot` — Wave 1 foundation.
- `openOODA/audit/demo_rollup.oot` — Wave 2 demos.
- `openOODA/audit/b8_root_cause.oot` — Wave 1 B8 typechecker.
- `openOODA/audit/migration_rollup.oot` — Wave 1-6 migration summary.
- `openOODA/SPRINT.oot` — task 10 closed.
